// Copy this file to Config.xcconfig (same folder) and fill in your own
// Supabase project's values. Config.xcconfig is gitignored so your values
// never get committed. See ../../SUPABASE_SETUP.md for where to find these.
//
// The anon key is Supabase's public client key (safe to ship in an app --
// access is enforced by the Row Level Security policies in
// supabase/migrations, not by keeping this key secret). The project URL is
// not sensitive either, but keeping both out of git avoids hardcoding a
// specific project into source control.

SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = YOUR-ANON-KEY
